From: Yar1klamer
Subject: [PATCH] media: i2c: ov13b10: add get_selection

libcamera needs the native size, the active pixel array and the analog
crop of the current mode to describe the sensor. Report them from the
window registers the modes program: every mode reads columns
0x000-0x108f and rows 0x008-0xc47, the full resolution mode outputs
4208x3120 of it from (15, 17), and the binned modes skip by two.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
